  'ba929ce1-8f41-1834-0a4f-ae45b80fff7f', 'guide', 'free', 'published', 'Product Idea Assessor: the Guide', 'product-idea-assessor', 'How to classify an idea as Copy, Improve or Differentiate, and why that classification should decide how much evidence you gather next.', 'Explains the Copy–Improve–Differentiate method end to end, with the reasoning behind each category and the single most useful test for each. Read this before using the Template or the Tool — both assume you understand the classification this guide teaches.',
