  'dcf1f382-9957-c65e-c3fc-84fbe30d3c02', 'tool', 'free', 'published', 'Product Idea Assessor', 'product-idea-assessor-tool', 'Answer a few questions about your idea and get a scored evidence-quality readiness verdict — proceed, gather more evidence, or pause.', 'The interactive version of the Copy–Improve–Differentiate Assessment. Classify your idea, answer four evidence questions, and get a deterministic score, a named strongest and weakest area, and one concrete next evidence action — usable anonymously, with no account required.',
  'A scored readiness verdict — ready to proceed, gather more evidence, or high risk — plus one clear next action.', 'Founders who want an immediate, structured read on a specific idea.', 'Use once you can state the idea in a sentence and have some evidence to answer honestly.', 'Not a substitute for the underlying customer evidence — it scores the evidence you already have, it doesn''t gather it for you.',
  5, 10, 'beginner', '1.0',
  null, null, 'GBP', null, true,
  '2026-08-01T09:00:00Z', null, 'Product Idea Assessor — free interactive idea assessment tool', 'Answer a few questions and get a scored, evidence-based readiness verdict on your product idea, free, no account required.', '{"placeholder":true}'::jsonb,
