  '8a89a76f-2289-3369-c1eb-f33755a0cc23', 'guide', 'free', 'published', 'Better Decision Maker: the Guide', 'better-decision-maker', 'Four techniques for deciding under uncertainty: reversibility, inversion, simple rules and expected value.', 'Explains how to classify a decision by reversibility, invert the question to find what would guarantee failure, check it against your simple rules, and estimate expected value when you have real options to compare. Read this before the Template or the Tool — both assume the technique this guide teaches.',
